  "solution": "Điều kiện xác định của hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>ln</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo>;</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tTập hợp này chứa các số nguyên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>𝒟</mi></semantics></math> chứa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>7</mn></semantics></math> số nguyên.",
